<mxCell id="hb_lora_rule" value="&lt;b style=&quot;color:#4C1D95;&quot;&gt;Automatic SGLang LoRA Resolution (lora_targets.py + apply_sglang_lora_targets.py):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Served Targets:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;[q_proj, k_proj, v_proj, o_proj, out_proj]&lt;/code&gt; (patches Mamba &lt;code&gt;out_proj&lt;/code&gt; dim &lt;code&gt;H·P → D&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Filtered Out:&lt;/b&gt; &lt;code&gt;in_proj&lt;/code&gt; (SGLang Nemotron-H 2-of-5 partition layout) &amp; &lt;code&gt;input/output_linear&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Norm Patch (apply_sglang_granite_norm.py):&lt;/b&gt; Fixes SGLang v0.5.19 double-residual final RMSNorm." style="rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0F766E;strokeWidth=1.5;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=10.0;fontColor=#0F172A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="340" y="874" width="548" height="88" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
